\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I Would commune with Thee, my God;
\par E'en to Thy seat I come;
\par I leave my joys, I leave my sins,
\par And seek in Thee my home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I stand upon the mount of God,
\par With sunlight in my soul;
\par I hear the storms in vales beneath,
\par I hear the thunders roll.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. But I am calm with Thee, my God,
\par Beneath these glorious skies;
\par And to the height on which I stand,
\par Nor storms nor clouds can rise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O this is life! O this is joy!
\par My God to find Thee so!
\par Thy face to see, Thy voice to hear,
\par And all Thy love to know.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

